"score in proportion rather than removing anybody - except on a line the seat"
" marked mandatory, which is a gate."
msgstr ""

#. module: aic_hrm_match
#: model:aic.hrm.match.criterion,description:aic_hrm_match.criterion_project_similarity
msgid ""
"How much of what this work involves the person has actually done. Rare "
"domains count for more than common ones, related domains count for "
"something, and older work counts for less."
msgstr ""

#. module: aic_hrm_match
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:aic_hrm_match.field_aic_hrm_match_tag_category__similarity_weight
msgid ""
